Decision and sequencing: Presentation lane only after B021 is closed. Decision: show named ZIP/raw/marginal-map byte deltas with explicit compression context through a shared replaceable formatter, avoiding ambiguous c|u notation.

Parallel lane refinement: develop a small replaceable embedded-size presentation helper and dedicated tests in NEW files only; integration waits active renderer lane. Prefer explicit named ZIP/raw/marginal-map columns, signed deltas and ratio with clear unavailable/baseline labels. No ambiguous c|u shorthand or percentage claims without denominator.

Review disposition: formatter is intentionally format-neutral plain text, not raw HTML. Returning an unescaped reason is correct at this seam; every renderer must encode it at the output boundary. During integration add hostile reason tests across console/HTML/Markdown to prove escaping; avoid double encoding.